  "name": "beads",
  "displayName": "Beads",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "Beads 1.3.4 for planning work with agents, across repositories: everything beads records about work. Beads with status, type, priority, labels, creator, spec, planning and outside-system facts; every kind of link with who added it and when; gates, leases, waves, history, comments, dispatch facts, interactions and provenance events. Answers what is ready, blocked, held, stale, who did what, and how far each repository's copy has got.",
